### 🚀 Core Value Proposition
This is a **16-patch set** (Block 00 + Blocks 01–15) designed to be applied on0.39.993.588 I sched_graph_realloc: graph reallocation: nodes = 5217 (changed = 0), splits = 50, n_same = 7, n_diff = 0
